                      <p class="block">The US Accidents Intelligence Hub is an advanced Streamlit-based analytics and visualization platform for comprehensive traffic accident data analysis across the United States. Built using 7.7M+ accident records from 2016-2023, it implements multiple machine learning models including PyCaret AutoML and AutoGluon ensemble methods to predict accident severity levels (1-4) with up to 90.6% accuracy. The interactive web application provides real-time predictions, geographic visualizations, and deep insights into accident patterns through an intuitive dashboard interface.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div data-work-problem class="pt-[1.5vmax]">
                    <div class="flex justify-start items-center" style="height:calc(var(--header-height) + 5vmax)">
