                    <div
                      class="text-[max(1.3rem,2.5vmax)] leading-[120%] md:leading-[110%] flex flex-col gap-[2vmax] text-light1">
                      <p class="block">The platform addresses the critical challenge of predicting traffic accident severity in highly imbalanced datasets where severity distributions are skewed across four classes (minor to severe impact). It identifies key contributing factors including weather conditions, temporal patterns, geographic locations, and road infrastructure features that influence accident outcomes for better traffic management and safety planning.</p>
                      
                      <p class="block">The solution implements advanced data balancing techniques like SMOTE and undersampling to handle class imbalance while comparing traditional ML models against modern AutoML frameworks.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
